{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:ClimaxVolumeMass.LocalShadowOrdering","@type":"LeanModule","name":"ClimaxVolumeMass.LocalShadowOrdering","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Basic"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.LocalShadowOrdering.holds_on_neighborhood","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.LocalShadowOrdering.holds_on_neighborhood","kind":"theorem","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/local-shadow-ordering.lean#L52-L52","doc":"**The ordering's content**: the low partition has at-most-equal\nshadow-price magnitude throughout the neighborhood —\n`|y_{λ₁}(q')| ≤ |y_{λ₂}(q')|` for every `q' ∈ U`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.LocalShadowOrdering.mem_self","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.LocalShadowOrdering.mem_self","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/local-shadow-ordering.lean#L48-L48","doc":"The point `q` lies in its own neighborhood. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.LocalShadowOrdering.nbhd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.LocalShadowOrdering.nbhd","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/local-shadow-ordering.lean#L46-L46","doc":"A predicate cutting out the neighborhood `U ∋ q` of the `.md`\ndefinition (membership `nbhd q'` ↔ `q' ∈ U`); `mem_self`\nrecords `q ∈ U`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.LocalShadowOrdering.y_high","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.LocalShadowOrdering.y_high","kind":"def","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/local-shadow-ordering.lean#L42-L42","doc":"Shadow price `y_{λ₂}(·)` of the high partition. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.LocalShadowOrdering.y_low","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.LocalShadowOrdering.y_low","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/local-shadow-ordering.lean#L40-L40","doc":"Shadow price `y_{λ₁}(·)` of the low partition. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.LocalShadowOrdering.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.LocalShadowOrdering.q","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/local-shadow-ordering.lean#L38-L38","doc":"Substrate parameter at which the ordering is asserted. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.LocalShadowOrdering.partition_high","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.LocalShadowOrdering.partition_high","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/local-shadow-ordering.lean#L36-L36","doc":"Partition λ₂ ⊢ k₂. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.LocalShadowOrdering.partition_low","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.LocalShadowOrdering.partition_low","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/local-shadow-ordering.lean#L34-L34","doc":"Partition λ₁ ⊢ k₁. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.LocalShadowOrdering.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.LocalShadowOrdering.mk","kind":"ctor","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/local-shadow-ordering.lean#L31-L31","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.LocalShadowOrdering","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.LocalShadowOrdering","kind":"structure","line":16,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/local-shadow-ordering.lean#L16-L52","doc":"**Local shadow-price ordering** `λ₁ ≼_q λ₂` at point `q : R`.\n\n`LocalShadowOrdering R` records two partitions, their shadow-price\nfunctions, the point `q`, and the witnessing neighborhood data:\na predicate `nbhd` cutting out an open set containing `q` on which\n`|y₁| ≤ |y₂|` pointwise.  This is the `.md` definition\n`λ₁ ≼_q λ₂ ⟺ ∃ U ∋ q open, |y_{λ₁}(q')| ≤ |y_{λ₂}(q')| ∀ q' ∈ U`,\nwith `nbhd` standing in for the open set `U` (the topological\nopenness of `U` is an external hypothesis — for `ℝ` the Euclidean\ntopology, for `ℚ_p` the `p`-adic — but the *order content*, the\npointwise magnitude inequality on `U`, is encoded here).\n\n§7c: only the ordered-ring structure is used — `|·|` needs a `Neg` and a\nlattice order, nothing here divides — so `[CommRing R]` is the weakest\ntypeclass admitting the construction; no field is required. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:local-shadow-ordering","label":"def:local-shadow-ordering","md":"quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/local-shadow-ordering.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}